---

<section class="wire-puzzle" aria-labelledby="wire-puzzle-title">
  <header class="puzzle-kicker">
    <p>WIRE SERVICE ARCHIVE / DECEMBER 1989</p>
    <h2 id="wire-puzzle-title">The Chronology Anomaly</h2>
    <p>CASE FILE 01 / SHIPPING MANIFEST</p>
  </header>

  <div class="dispatch-sheet">
    <div class="dispatch-meta">
      <span>DATELINE: PANAMA CITY</span>
      <span>FILED: DEC 25, 1989</span>
      <span>PRIORITY: ROUTINE</span>
    </div>
    <h3>MEDICAL SOFTWARE CONSIGNMENT CLEARS PORT</h3>
    <p>
      A cargo vessel bearing sealed software packages from <strong
        >PC-CYBORG CORP, PANAMA</strong
      > cleared customs this morning. Port officials reported 20,000 diskette mailers
      addressed to research offices and medical organizations in North America.
    </p>
    <p>
      The manifest lists the cargo as <strong>"AIDS INFORMATION VOL. 1"</strong
      >, with payment instructions enclosed separately. Dock personnel said the
      packages contained a start-up utility identified as <strong
        >command.exe</strong
      >.
    </p>
    <p>
      A company representative could not be reached for comment. The cargo is
      scheduled for postal distribution before the end of the year.
    </p>
    <p class="editor-note">
      ARCHIVIST'S LEAD: The filename is wrong for the 1989 record. Search the
      edition for a second discrepancy.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="terminal-direction">
    Cross-reference the archive and record any recovered key at the switchboard
    terminal.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .wire-puzzle {
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }
  .puzzle-kicker {
    border-bottom: 3px double var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .puzzle-kicker h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }
  .dispatch-sheet {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
  }
  .dispatch-meta {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.45rem;
  }
  .dispatch-sheet h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .dispatch-sheet p + p {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .anomaly {
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 2px dashed #b42318;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .anomaly.flagged {
    background: #f9dfdb;
    outline: 2px solid #b42318;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .editor-note {
    color: #b42318;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .investigation-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .tool-button {
    background: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--off-white);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .tool-button:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }
  .investigation-status,
  .keyword-feedback {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    min-height: 1.2rem;
  }
  .terminal-direction {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hidden-locator {
    background: #18111b;
    border: 2px solid #18111b;
    color: #18111b;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hidden-locator.revealed {
    background: #21112d;
    border-color: #8cff69;
    color: #8cff69;
    text-shadow: 0 0 6px #8cff69;
  }
  .hidden-locator strong,
  .hidden-locator span {
    display: block;
  }
  .hidden-locator strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
  }
  .hidden-locator span {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
  }
  .keyword-form {
    align-items: end;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .keyword-form label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .keyword-form input {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .keyword-form.solved input {
    border-color: #2d7a3e;
  }
  .keyword-feedback {
    color: #b42318;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .keyword-form.solved + .keyword-feedback {
    color: #2d7a3e;
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .wire-puzzle {
      padding: 0.9rem;
    }
    .keyword-form {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .keyword-form .tool-button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
